      "description": "Endpoints powering the Kovera Network Map Portal (see PRD v1.0, April 2025).\n\nAll endpoints live under `/api/analytics/network/` and are **publicly accessible** — no auth, no role gating. Full addresses, user IDs, and edge metadata are returned to every caller.\n\nNodes use normalized blank-plane `(x, y)` coordinates (0–1000 range) derived from server-side geocoding.",
