              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns the full network graph: nodes (user homes, seeded listings, dream addresses, pure buyers) and edges (likes, dream links, chain-ready edges).\n\nIncludes addresses, user IDs, edge metadata, and normalized `(x, y)` positions."
